Bundled with Curve Cut as the tour's demo/calibration model, unmodified.
voron-cube.stl.b64.js in this folder is the same STL, zlib-compressed and
base64-encoded by tools/embed_demo.py so the demo works from file:// (browsers
refuse fetch() of local files). The GPL-3.0 applies to it equally.
